### `crates/lattice-ui-tui/src/render.rs` — `draw_file_tree_pane` (lines 1344–1388)

Currently:
```rust
fn draw_file_tree_pane(frame, area, app, pane, is_active) {
    let Some(tree) = app.buffers.file_tree(pane.buffer_id) else { return; };
    let (cursor_line, scroll) = if is_active { ... } else { ... };
    let viewport = area.height as usize;
    let lines: Vec<Line> = tree
        .content
        .as_string()
        .split('\n')
        .skip(scroll)
        .take(viewport)
        .enumerate()
        .map(|(i, l)| {
